## What it was

Taco Labs was the name I shipped prototypes under in summer 2025: fast, solo product bets to see what stuck.

- **Level Up Your Kid**: a gamified parenting app, pitched as Duolingo for parenting.
- **LoveStory**: a generator for personalized, illustrated love-story books.
- **ARMA**: a DeFi research agent.
- Smaller mocks: an AI health coach, a persona-driven website-testing bot and a computer-vision test bench.

Most were mocks and spikes; the point was speed and learning, not shipping.
